</table></div>
<p class="np">At first this looked fatal: all the futures profit came from trades near the swaps, and the mid-month trades lost money. But \(12\) trades is too few to judge. The real test was to run the exact same strategy, same settings and same costs, on spot prices.</p>

<div class="sh">The same strategy on spot prices</div>
